      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Deployment recipes in the Alpamayo Developer Hub enable inference optimization with TensorRT and DFlash2, achieving 160-190 ms pixel-to-trajectory latency on DRIVE AGX Thor.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/running-av-reasoning-models-within-onboard-compute-and-latency-limits/",
